==Battleground==
*20 [[Assassin Bear]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns.

==Strategy==
The objective is to kill Shy Boy as fast as possible, then reach the base immediately. Taking too long to do so results in defeat. Make sure to have a first row full of [[Cat Combo|combos]], as you'll barely be able to summon any Cats throughout the stage; as for the rest, bring cheap Cats with high DPS against [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] or [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemies (e.g. [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale]], [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Elemental Duelist]], [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman]] etc.) and either [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]], [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Express Cat]] or another fast [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rusher]] for the end. Start with the damage dealers, without caring for your base receiving damage, then summon the fast rusher as soon as Shy Boy dies.

When the weekly missions of the [[Catnip Challenges]] appear, there is a 50% chance that one of them will be to clear [[Stories of Legend]] stages ten times. Torture Room is an ideal pick to quickly complete that mission due to how quickly it can be beaten and the low [[Cat Energy|energy]] cost.

